00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:27,000
possibility. The appearance of language may not have required a dramatic neurological leap. It may have been more like the last piece of a puzzle clicking

131
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:38,000
into place. A small change perhaps in the neural circuitry controlling voluntary vocalization, perhaps in the working memory systems that allow longer sequences to be held and manipulated.

132
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:46,000
That unlocked everything else. The jump wasn't from silence to Shakespeare. It was from a rich layered multi-channel

